flowchart LR
  dev[Developer commit / PR] --> gh[GitHub Actions]
  gh --> build[./mvnw verify\nunit + Testcontainers integration tests]
  build --> jar[Package executable JAR\nSpring Boot Maven plugin]
  jar --> s3[Upload application version bundle to S3]
  s3 --> ebDeploy[Elastic Beanstalk deploy\nrolling with additional batch]
  ebDeploy --> health[Health check /actuator/health\nvia ALB]
  health -->|healthy| done[Traffic shifted to new instances]
  health -->|unhealthy| rollback[Automatic rollback to previous version]
  flyway[Flyway migrations run at app start\nbackward compatible only] -.-> ebDeploy
